<title>USA: WesBanco completes Shawnee acquisition.</title>
<headline>WesBanco completes Shawnee acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>WHEELING, W.Va. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>WesBanco Inc said Monday that it has completed its merger of Shawnee Bank Inc in Charleston, West Virginia, into WesBanco affiliate, WesBanco Bank Charleston.</p>
<p>As a result of the merger, Shawnee shareholders received 10.094 shares of WesBanco common stock for each share of Shawnee common stock in a tax-free exchange.</p>
<p>The transaction, which will be accounted for as a purchase transaction, was based upon a fixed exchange ratio that was not affected by a recently announced WesBanco common stock split.</p>
</text>
